{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_06eeb9b112005d4f77656715d8e43968151aff2864ba5ded782ac5967ebb0b1b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5ca0a3adea50d2aff534494fa7e75235bcfd817a27bb6b4bf4e6dff550afe8d5","slc_aa7de37107f9c80a10698e86101e93b3a945012d7baa99736680f3d7c54fa68b"],"source_ids":["src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"Hive does not provide sandboxing, multi-user authentication, or any bundled agent model; it coordinates CLIs the user already runs locally, and same-machine processes reaching the local port are treated as trusted.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_14a7556807ef01215f295139cef32b37e1adfaf16290c5fcf174b9d2add04045","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3bb6d1d8d208f6e2f153278da298a30b4225cb236d0068767943eeb33f46c99f","slc_bdedc4e10f61c897dbc583043d087674c9a3aba595072827a8c9d846acaeaaed"],"source_ids":["src_5c2ec21c3c925da6b24593d4ae2dc6f1","src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"The web shell is installable as a PWA in Chromium browsers via the omnibox install icon, with a service worker that caches the SPA shell and assets but never intercepts /api/*, /ws/*, or non-GET requests.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1f30d7325dee632d4e90818049be47911d2f936c813f7323da9584967dc6e44d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5ca0a3adea50d2aff534494fa7e75235bcfd817a27bb6b4bf4e6dff550afe8d5","slc_7bd8e00e97cf112d019bc674e7f9b1e94dafa9918d8303e0ae2bd8dfab5b77dc","slc_988466ea6d491b1fe93d7522163ad78410ceb3d3b319b274e44085819951e852","slc_f1fd372fffd5545185ec551eb4db31a19568241b72216f43e5d085066d56928f"],"source_ids":["src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"Hive is local-first: the runtime binds to 127.0.0.1, stores SQLite metadata under ~/.config/hive (or %APPDATA%\\hive on Windows, or $HIVE_DATA_DIR), and the browser UI talks to it over HTTP and WebSocket.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_275ef0ca4ddc880471f825963dee1fe42aa3e6acd15dfefc46f37d6f765712e6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4ff23993eaf5758d41ef93b478f2b9c10ddc20bc47d027a5c1a55102f96aefa0","slc_f1fd372fffd5545185ec551eb4db31a19568241b72216f43e5d085066d56928f"],"source_ids":["src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"An experimental Workflows feature (off by default) lets the Orchestrator author and run multi-stage multi-agent workflows, with a Workflows panel showing runs, phase results, logs, schedules, and stop controls, plus a CLI policy for workflow-created agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2c8f27c6e25a8b43d64c55dfb011a70ee27104b315e06d764f385195438b8596","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d94fb6da19ab732d998b9b4f9d44def3f81a2ded7752d26600df3ed388fafc0f"],"source_ids":["src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"Hive runs CLI agents (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini, OpenCode, Qwen, and others) as real PTY processes on the local machine, with a browser workbench where an Orchestrator plans and delegates to workers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_31a60a9f9b9229542963b9ff3473fa0aeccdf2771f9a11da9896ce8c64dbb783","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6fdae164bd86489f2dc647b6cc66f578fd26bddfbd43654e5d656e22f6f6a723","slc_bf25715da738919bc7e2560fa1d6326003749887d8ec8e31aaa10ce1b7b7c15b","slc_e1e33eae6615547c0a7113ff1f9258286b46e27e48345b9c25332773d961ef7a"],"source_ids":["src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"The shared task graph is a markdown file at `<workspace>/.hive/tasks.md` that users can inspect or edit outside the app, and the editor handles external-file conflicts with Reload/Keep Local options.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_370da2c42b4f1bb160c4f4bb855465d7a231e71a15f6b57e211124eae72a6c9a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_18ae7fa4ed5d724aabeec63ed30f814cff5811d5b48e1809aeeddf250bdc3ac8","slc_ac75df6905eab78d2cb778a4f7f72d6cbb40a91ad3e63c1c952cf40d507adc60","slc_b30229368f5d3531fa1b264a1d333ee7c6faef7429c4d726b8ec696df2b29d96"],"source_ids":["src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors develop with pnpm (`pnpm install`, `pnpm dev`, `pnpm check`, `pnpm build`, `pnpm test`); dev mode runs the runtime on port 4010 with Vite on 5180 proxying API and WebSocket traffic.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_545826e3e56ae737a858c1c5741e46b7508d82fb8aa20bd7338db4fda4c517f5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_72332034750644b56d56b2eae6e76e18cf7c6b9d39e1481c4c03e2194a01bdf2","slc_9d77ff5d3ba52a30c936b2296cf57414c514e6fd5fdd56161472c36679b30e72","slc_a6097e397eeb9025a0a23a1c02824fec961ed26e52941617d8cd5e106c70206b","slc_aabf8eb698a32c0ddf47b7c43eb4a0534677b15e054ff89e7709dab23bac1927","slc_c47cf771dc05e7ccdb4518f5c3cf574610d05a23ddba518c6e9581456838196c"],"source_ids":["src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"Hive targets users who already run CLI agents and want coordination for multi-agent work such as implement/review splits, parallel bug hunts, and research/draft/fact-check pipelines, without juggling terminal windows.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7741b9c5651ebf26cf106aff78086a89cea6d7e17c1efc939f9ba1f46106bae3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1e0801fc28865861d5b95d7206153bab117af7b3f1ca56846a7b539ba1e91c08","slc_ed9ecfbc0c3e89583207318799c3c3e0940f18fb77f50b2c810d936ab00d341e","slc_f85e5214c352e30e1491c06168ae7fa6eaaa6c51c449d824009799100fa6fe36"],"source_ids":["src_5c2ec21c3c925da6b24593d4ae2dc6f1","src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"Optional Remote access (off by default) pairs a phone to the desktop via a desktop-confirmed pairing flow and relays through an end-to-end encrypted gateway; paired devices have the same authority as the local browser and can be revoked, and CLI subcommands like `hive remote login/status/devices/revoke` manage it.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_815b740adffdb023271ef1961cb39cee10173648245cdda3f4760f496689b819","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_307f6403befbbbd661fa09fed70106fac637a4138c3f59f96da9633a037ff145","slc_4161a994a45a54b48c717bf632106e831b74295089861244383a2808eb612091","slc_7abb5f6f80b92e138a096f288230561aabeb2437d6376142d5ec4a591f296267","slc_824af8b5c909d49c95228528c94db1f4d6f4b098a0e0f2ff15f6c1d6f0f47488"],"source_ids":["src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"Hive requires Node.js 22 or newer and depends on native packages node-pty and better-sqlite3, so native build tooling may be needed when prebuilt binaries are unavailable; agent CLIs must be installed and authenticated by the user, not by Hive.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.5,"id":"clm_95c31f7f9e6ac56d3d42db7a1bdf29808e32383b1e78f700e9e59904b6f7940d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=inference; facet=evaluation","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ac75df6905eab78d2cb778a4f7f72d6cbb40a91ad3e63c1c952cf40d507adc60"],"source_ids":["src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"No evidence in the provided slices describes any benchmark or success-rate evaluation of the agent system; the only test-related material is the repository's own `pnpm test` check, so agent performance evaluation appears undocumented here.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b856361d8448c23b5ed4eb44f2b868a2f4875fc74461780e281f23fc28adae3c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e7a43b4e0a6dad58f14ff570af6cf1b009952145f8b2ab2d815914d0ac2298bb"],"source_ids":["src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"A fully client-side demo mode (fake orchestrator plus two workers with prerecorded scrollback and a prefilled task list) is available from the first-run wizard without a server or any real CLI agent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cc624db332fe4912c8f74607df88f39cd1efd535f6ec9489af09c300c9792b71","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3cdf3c81e093d522b7998fc3ce0d5df868ffcb4629ed70955b702899b5cc62b2","slc_bf25715da738919bc7e2560fa1d6326003749887d8ec8e31aaa10ce1b7b7c15b"],"source_ids":["src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"The Orchestrator is itself a real agent CLI process, not a scripted manager; it dispatches tasks with `team send <worker> \"<task>\"` and workers report back with `team report`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_eae4861820d35373f3b20253dd2983e74635ee9065b4dd4534f56527111d061b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_f1fd372fffd5545185ec551eb4db31a19568241b72216f43e5d085066d56928f","slc_f5f70ad95b80f27b2531dd5c1eb8014263de2ada282e2fac5e8ef3a826edc69b"],"source_ids":["src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"Auto-staff (experimental, on by default) lets the Orchestrator `team spawn` temporary coders, testers, and reviewers sized to the task, and Hive dismisses those ephemeral workers once their dispatch reports back.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f70a5580df06360455211a27adfac197f86b2a2ffcf00c6dfe1d0903d23ea8ba","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"tt-a1i/hive@1096789b17cc snapshot 70e013b173adfc67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5ca0a3adea50d2aff534494fa7e75235bcfd817a27bb6b4bf4e6dff550afe8d5","slc_aa7de37107f9c80a10698e86101e93b3a945012d7baa99736680f3d7c54fa68b","slc_f72056b5f879415a51ab9dbe11c7feb742d67372868cfeb02917562dfc104d45"],"source_ids":["src_c3192e1b0d6b56b18d51856b0b18c0bd"],"text":"Built-in agent presets intentionally launch CLIs in bypass/non-interactive modes (e.g. `--dangerously-skip-permissions` for Claude Code, `--yolo` for Gemini), so workers can run arbitrary shell commands in the workspace; Hive provides no sandboxing or multi-user auth.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65f79b7b45f94d408841e9ad5aa2bc3d"}
